WEBVTT

00:00:01.174 --> 00:00:02.744
Espers.

00:00:02.744 --> 00:00:05.804
Those who possess powers
different from ordinary people.

00:00:06.044 --> 00:00:09.174
Wielders of psychic powers.

00:00:14.684 --> 00:00:18.154
So... Why'd you invite me out?

00:00:18.154 --> 00:00:19.384
Well, you see...

00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:22.894
Sorry for breaking in
when it was getting good.

00:00:22.894 --> 00:00:24.694
Men should have more courage and
make the first move, though.

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:28.204
How's it going?

00:00:28.564 --> 00:00:32.134
Just as predicted. There's a
bomb in the central shaft.

00:00:32.134 --> 00:00:33.004
Gotcha.

00:00:33.004 --> 00:00:34.944
Aoi, get the passengers out at once!

00:00:34.944 --> 00:00:35.674
On it!

00:00:39.744 --> 00:00:42.284
Kaoru, it's almost time. Are you ready?

00:00:42.284 --> 00:00:43.274
Okay!

00:00:49.454 --> 00:00:52.254
All right! PSYCHIC...

00:00:52.254 --> 00:00:55.824
Um... VENUS CATCH!

00:00:58.194 --> 00:00:59.094
All right!

00:00:59.764 --> 00:01:02.574
That's the way! Now transport it to a safe place!

00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:04.934
I know! Jeez!

00:01:09.014 --> 00:01:11.014
Ooh, look at them all!

00:01:11.014 --> 00:01:13.104
I've started my own countdown here!

00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:16.144
Hey! What are you doing, Kaoru?!

00:01:24.024 --> 00:01:24.954
Espers.

00:01:24.954 --> 00:01:29.894
Those with psychic powers who protect
the bright future of mankind.

00:01:30.134 --> 00:01:32.754
Bright future... Right.

00:01:33.304 --> 00:01:36.204
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:01:36.604 --> 00:01:39.474
Maji de ii kanji

00:01:39.844 --> 00:01:42.604
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:43.044 --> 00:01:46.204
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:48.114 --> 00:01:49.254
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:49.254 --> 00:01:50.414
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:50.414 --> 00:01:51.684
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:51.684 --> 00:01:53.354
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:53.354 --> 00:01:54.374
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:54.554 --> 00:01:57.854
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:57.854 --> 00:02:00.294
Kokoro no limiter

00:02:01.024 --> 00:02:03.724
Tokihanatareta hora

00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:07.324
Yes! Change the world!

00:02:07.564 --> 00:02:10.434
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:02:10.734 --> 00:02:14.044
Real wo tsuranuite

00:02:14.044 --> 00:02:17.274
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:02:17.274 --> 00:02:20.214
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:02:21.344 --> 00:02:27.824
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:02:27.824 --> 00:02:33.764
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:02:34.194 --> 00:02:40.594
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:02:40.804 --> 00:02:45.334
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:49.434
We can try over the future world!

00:02:49.674 --> 00:02:50.044
Yeah!

00:02:50.774 --> 00:02:51.434
Saidai!

00:02:53.584 --> 00:02:54.804
Daitan!

00:03:04.694 --> 00:03:06.714
26th sense.
"A Change of Prediction? The Future Dances!"

00:03:07.124 --> 00:03:08.794
Fortunately, no one was injured.

00:03:08.794 --> 00:03:12.634
However, plans to rebuild are still up in the air.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:16.264
I hope the people from BABEL are
more careful in the future.

00:03:18.674 --> 00:03:19.834
Kaoru, you...

00:03:19.904 --> 00:03:22.304
Right, right! I said I was sorry!

00:03:22.374 --> 00:03:25.504
But how could I help it with
so many babes there?

00:03:25.744 --> 00:03:27.784
Were they that hot?

00:03:27.784 --> 00:03:32.084
Their hot, dewy eyes and lips were just
inviting me in the most romantic way!

00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:33.344
You girls!

00:03:35.024 --> 00:03:40.224
"I want you! Kiss me, kiss me!"
Oh, to have that whispered in your ear!

00:03:40.224 --> 00:03:42.694
Sakaki, what are you doing here?

00:03:42.694 --> 00:03:46.794
You guys really put on a show.
It's like a circus downstairs.

00:03:49.204 --> 00:03:53.174
The public information office
will release a statement.
Please, no interviews! I can't comment!

00:03:53.174 --> 00:03:53.944
Oh, no! I can't tell you that!
Please, no interviews! I can't comment!

00:03:53.944 --> 00:03:54.844
Oh, no! I can't tell you that!
Oh, yes. I do skin treatments every night.

00:03:54.844 --> 00:03:57.074
Oh, yes. I do skin treatments every night.

00:03:57.074 --> 00:03:58.314
I have a group date!

00:03:58.314 --> 00:04:01.184
Man, the world is such a cold place!

00:04:01.184 --> 00:04:04.214
We do the best we can!

00:04:04.214 --> 00:04:05.484
It can't be helped.

00:04:05.754 --> 00:04:08.554
Most people in the world are Normals.

00:04:09.224 --> 00:04:12.214
Darn it, I wanna go to a
southern island and have fun!

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:13.394
Kaoru...
To chase some swimsuit babes around!

00:04:13.394 --> 00:04:14.324
To chase some swimsuit babes around!

00:04:14.324 --> 00:04:15.654
Look, Minamoto...

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:18.734
Let's go on a vacation for once!

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:21.964
We'll be on the beach and it'll be
all "Wait! Wait! I'll catch you!"

00:04:21.964 --> 00:04:25.904
"Eek! No! Ha-ha-ha!" Come on!

00:04:27.944 --> 00:04:30.044
Why am I the one being chased?!

00:04:30.044 --> 00:04:32.274
No fair! I wanna do it, too!

00:04:32.274 --> 00:04:33.874
Don't pull any end-runs!

00:04:34.014 --> 00:04:34.384
I suppose, but then... How do we work this?

00:04:34.384 --> 00:04:36.384
Listen to me!
I suppose, but then... How do we work this?

00:04:36.384 --> 00:04:37.714
I suppose, but then... How do we work this?

00:04:40.254 --> 00:04:42.184
Damn you, media!

00:04:42.424 --> 00:04:46.794
Just stirring up trouble
because it's a slow news day!

00:04:46.794 --> 00:04:48.364
Chief, don't!

00:04:48.364 --> 00:04:51.384
Calm down! What if you make things worse?!
Let me go, Minamoto! I'll show them!

00:04:53.234 --> 00:04:56.404
Still, yet again, we couldn't stop
a prediction from happening.

00:04:56.404 --> 00:04:58.494
It can't be helped, Minamoto.

00:04:59.474 --> 00:05:04.304
It's the nature of precognition.
You can't completely avoid them.

00:05:04.914 --> 00:05:09.314
The best we can do is minimize the damage.

00:05:09.784 --> 00:05:13.114
But human beings have the power
to determine their own futures!

00:05:15.054 --> 00:05:16.284
Chief!

00:05:16.424 --> 00:05:18.284
We received a message from the lieutenant!

00:05:18.524 --> 00:05:19.924
What? From the lieutenant?

00:05:20.594 --> 00:05:21.954
Huh? What lieutenant?

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:25.824
Minamoto, call an emergency
meeting of The Children!

00:05:33.774 --> 00:05:36.714
BABEL 1? Looks like the chief's aboard, too!

00:05:36.714 --> 00:05:38.804
That's strange. Did they change the schedule?

00:05:39.444 --> 00:05:41.174
Always a pleasure to serve!

00:05:51.124 --> 00:05:53.924
BABEL-ADMINSTERED DESERTED ISLE,
OKINAWA PREFECTURE

00:05:56.364 --> 00:05:57.884
The Children, released!

00:06:10.744 --> 00:06:15.114
Look, Minamoto! The clear, virgin blue sea!

00:06:15.114 --> 00:06:17.084
The champagne gold sunlight!

00:06:17.084 --> 00:06:18.344
It's the best, isn't it?

00:06:18.454 --> 00:06:19.554
Yeah.

00:06:19.554 --> 00:06:20.254
Wait, what are you doing here?!

00:06:20.254 --> 00:06:21.654
Whew! Paradise!
Wait, what are you doing here?!

00:06:21.654 --> 00:06:22.284
Whew! Paradise!

00:06:26.724 --> 00:06:28.524
Kaoru, do it!

00:06:29.164 --> 00:06:32.394
All right! PSYCHIC WATER SKIMMING!

00:06:35.904 --> 00:06:38.804
Cut it out! Quit dragging me around!

00:06:38.804 --> 00:06:41.104
Looks like fun, Minamoto.

00:06:41.104 --> 00:06:43.344
And it's nice to see the girls smiling again.

00:06:43.344 --> 00:06:44.934
Don't just watch! HELP ME!

00:06:47.114 --> 00:06:48.914
Huh? On this island?

00:06:48.914 --> 00:06:49.784
Yes.

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:53.184
There's a Level 7 precog on this island?

00:06:53.184 --> 00:06:57.124
His predictions are always dead on.
But that's the problem.

00:06:58.924 --> 00:07:02.524
They're unavoidable. All of them.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:08.564
W-Wait a minute!

00:07:08.564 --> 00:07:12.174
I thought those three were the
only Level 7's in Japan!

00:07:12.174 --> 00:07:14.764
Exactly. He isn't human.

00:07:23.314 --> 00:07:24.914
Let me introduce you.

00:07:24.914 --> 00:07:28.914
The only esper dolphin to be experimentally
produced during the war.

00:07:29.354 --> 00:07:30.384
Minamoto!

00:07:32.694 --> 00:07:33.894
Look at us!

00:07:33.894 --> 00:07:35.324
Isn't it amazing?

00:07:35.324 --> 00:07:37.594
Beautiful girls riding a dolphin!

00:07:37.594 --> 00:07:41.054
Lieutenant 1-009, Level 7 esper!

00:07:45.434 --> 00:07:47.204
The lieutenant was assigned to

00:07:47.204 --> 00:07:50.144
one of the organizations
which later became BABEL.

00:07:50.774 --> 00:07:53.344
Actually, there are others like him in BABEL.

00:07:53.344 --> 00:07:55.504
No need for my background, Kiritsubo.

00:07:55.844 --> 00:07:58.044
The war ended long ago.

00:07:58.484 --> 00:08:01.454
Ladies and gentlemen, it's a pleasure.
Please call me Igo.

00:08:01.684 --> 00:08:02.794
Telepathy?

00:08:02.794 --> 00:08:04.154
Now I can never eat one.

00:08:04.154 --> 00:08:05.184
You wanted to?!

00:08:05.654 --> 00:08:10.154
Stop the disaster he's predicted.
That is your mission here.

00:08:10.664 --> 00:08:12.194
What's the prediction of?

00:08:12.194 --> 00:08:13.924
He'll tell you.

00:08:23.574 --> 00:08:24.444
Here.

00:08:25.144 --> 00:08:26.184
Fish?

00:08:26.184 --> 00:08:30.174
Go on, Minamoto. If you want
to talk, give them to him.

00:08:31.414 --> 00:08:34.084
Soothing touch, 120%!

00:08:34.084 --> 00:08:36.114
I don't sense a sliver of stress.

00:08:37.654 --> 00:08:40.324
Look, what are you saying is going to happen?

00:08:41.024 --> 00:08:43.154
My own death.

00:08:55.674 --> 00:08:59.344
Kyosuke, let's go someplace
and have fun! I'm bored!

00:08:59.344 --> 00:09:01.004
We're going? Where? Where?

00:09:01.184 --> 00:09:02.804
You'd best not come.

00:09:04.354 --> 00:09:05.284
Kyousuke?

00:09:09.454 --> 00:09:12.484
Shot with a gun? On a desert isle?

00:09:12.754 --> 00:09:13.784
Hm.

00:09:13.924 --> 00:09:16.124
No need for guns with
The Children guarding him.

00:09:16.964 --> 00:09:19.164
Our being here has been kept top secret.

00:09:19.164 --> 00:09:21.164
I don't think a shooting is possible.

00:09:21.164 --> 00:09:23.734
The helicopter pilot's safe, right?

00:09:23.734 --> 00:09:26.134
He's fine. I checked him before we took off.

00:09:26.134 --> 00:09:29.104
He didn't know our destination
until after takeoff.

00:09:29.714 --> 00:09:32.074
Only Kashiwagi knows we're here.

00:09:32.774 --> 00:09:34.884
I also called in Sakaki, just in case.

00:09:34.884 --> 00:09:36.614
It's been a while.

00:09:37.154 --> 00:09:40.854
Still fooling around, I see.
I hate men's cologne.

00:09:40.854 --> 00:09:42.684
Aw, don't say that again.

00:09:42.684 --> 00:09:45.884
Well, Lieutenant? This time, we'll
change the future for sure!

00:09:46.424 --> 00:09:49.124
Nothing is certain where fate is concerned.

00:09:49.894 --> 00:09:56.264
Besides, I've lived long enough.
Going to meet my comrades isn't so bad.

00:09:56.974 --> 00:09:59.404
The limitation treaty means
I have no more missions,

00:09:59.404 --> 00:10:03.874
and I can't live as wild dolphin now.
There's no place for me in this world.

00:10:03.874 --> 00:10:05.574
I have no attachment to it anymore...

00:10:06.884 --> 00:10:11.214
Agh! Lieutenant! Lieutenant?! Are you all right?!
Don't give up, old man! What's the
point in being an esper, then?!

00:10:11.214 --> 00:10:12.114
Don't give up, old man! What's the
point in being an esper, then?!

00:10:12.114 --> 00:10:13.624
I'm gonna fight!

00:10:13.624 --> 00:10:17.524
Yeah! During that incident with
the baby, I realized something.

00:10:17.524 --> 00:10:21.564
That maybe ESP exists to make people happy!

00:10:21.564 --> 00:10:25.764
If only you're going to die naturally. But the fact
that you're going to be killed is unforgivable!

00:10:28.734 --> 00:10:29.534
Girls...

00:10:29.904 --> 00:10:34.364
Of course, destiny will be changed!
Because we're here!

00:10:44.384 --> 00:10:45.854
Cut it out!

00:11:04.674 --> 00:11:08.034
Sure. Don't clean up and just
leave everything lying around.

00:11:08.704 --> 00:11:11.144
And Shiho left all her vegetables on the plate!

00:11:11.574 --> 00:11:16.184
Give it a rest, Minamoto. The girls are worn out.

00:11:16.184 --> 00:11:19.204
Lieutenant Igo has made over
three thousand predictions.

00:11:19.924 --> 00:11:23.824
All came true, no matter
what we did to stop them.

00:11:24.824 --> 00:11:29.564
Just this once, we shouldn't
think of success selfishly.

00:11:29.564 --> 00:11:31.234
Just this once.

00:11:31.234 --> 00:11:32.284
I believe in them.

00:11:33.704 --> 00:11:36.034
Those girls have the power to change the future!

00:11:38.204 --> 00:11:40.904
I've been waiting for someone
who would say that.

00:11:42.374 --> 00:11:43.034
Lieutenant?

00:11:44.974 --> 00:11:46.674
I think I can entrust this to you.

00:11:47.414 --> 00:11:50.254
Honestly, my death doesn't matter.

00:11:50.254 --> 00:11:53.554
But the truth is there's another
important prediction,

00:11:53.554 --> 00:11:55.214
and if possible, I'd like to prevent it.

00:11:56.284 --> 00:11:57.494
What is it?

00:11:57.494 --> 00:11:58.484
Behold.

00:12:06.564 --> 00:12:07.294
Don't move!

00:12:07.934 --> 00:12:10.264
Queen of Catastrophe...

00:12:10.504 --> 00:12:12.494
No... Kaoru!

00:12:17.574 --> 00:12:20.084
At this range, you'll definitely kill me.

00:12:20.084 --> 00:12:21.244
Shoot, Minamoto.

00:12:22.014 --> 00:12:25.044
But even if I'm gone, nothing will change.

00:12:25.514 --> 00:12:29.014
The other army of espers will never stop fighting.

00:12:29.524 --> 00:12:31.154
Then stop them!

00:12:31.624 --> 00:12:36.614
Please! Espers! Normals! What does
either side gain from this war?!

00:12:37.234 --> 00:12:40.064
Kaoru, where are you?!
The enemy's going to use nukes!

00:12:40.064 --> 00:12:42.004
The city's finished! Hurry!

00:12:44.504 --> 00:12:45.404
Kaoru!

00:12:45.404 --> 00:12:47.034
It's no use.

00:12:47.874 --> 00:12:50.004
Did you know, Minamoto? I...

00:12:50.474 --> 00:12:51.964
Kaoru, don't!

00:13:12.794 --> 00:13:13.964
Hey, Minamoto?

00:13:13.964 --> 00:13:15.554
What's wrong?

00:13:21.504 --> 00:13:23.604
It's not true! How can that be the future?!

00:13:35.424 --> 00:13:36.614
The smell of a male.

00:13:40.564 --> 00:13:41.394
Isu.

00:13:48.404 --> 00:13:52.894
Kaoru was an adult, but I hadn't changed much.

00:13:53.774 --> 00:13:55.504
Five years from now? Ten?

00:13:58.474 --> 00:14:00.444
His predictions are unavoidable.

00:14:01.344 --> 00:14:04.754
Impossible! A war between
Normals and espers?

00:14:04.754 --> 00:14:05.914
Hey!

00:14:08.284 --> 00:14:11.594
What are you doing, Minamoto?
Can't you sleep?

00:14:11.594 --> 00:14:14.654
K-Kaoru! It's nothing, really!

00:14:21.864 --> 00:14:22.994
Hey, Minamoto?

00:14:24.404 --> 00:14:26.564
We'll save the old dolphin, right?

00:14:27.544 --> 00:14:29.164
The future can be changed, right?

00:14:33.944 --> 00:14:35.184
Yeah.

00:14:35.184 --> 00:14:39.584
If we can prevent today's prediction,
I won't need to worry about anything!

00:14:41.224 --> 00:14:45.244
Of course. If we couldn't, then our
free will would be meaningless.

00:14:45.554 --> 00:14:48.084
Minamoto, there's something else.

00:14:48.894 --> 00:14:50.484
When is Miss Oboro coming?

00:14:51.464 --> 00:14:54.534
I thought I'd get to see her in a swimsuit!

00:14:54.534 --> 00:14:57.364
It'd be amazing! I know it would!

00:14:57.504 --> 00:14:58.994
Go to bed!

00:15:02.104 --> 00:15:03.474
Yes, Minamoto here.

00:15:03.474 --> 00:15:04.874
It's Kashiwagi.

00:15:05.374 --> 00:15:06.674
This is an emergency!

00:15:07.314 --> 00:15:10.804
That island's dangerous!
Get back to Tokyo at once!

00:15:11.214 --> 00:15:12.684
What?!

00:15:16.954 --> 00:15:20.794
All right! You can't escape us now,
Kiritsubo, you esper-lover!

00:15:20.794 --> 00:15:23.784
Don't waste this chance!
Do it like we practiced!

00:15:25.094 --> 00:15:26.964
A plan to assassinate me?!

00:15:26.964 --> 00:15:30.504
Yes. A helicopter maintenance
man was their spy!

00:15:30.504 --> 00:15:32.904
He put a transmitter on BABEL 1.

00:15:32.904 --> 00:15:34.544
We'll turn the tables on them!

00:15:34.544 --> 00:15:37.974
No! You girls will head out to the
open seas with the lieutenant!

00:15:37.974 --> 00:15:39.674
But, Chief!

00:15:39.674 --> 00:15:43.614
My death hasn't been predicted. It's
the lieutenant that's in danger!

00:15:44.514 --> 00:15:47.554
Do whatever it takes to keep that
prediction from coming true!

00:15:47.554 --> 00:15:50.424
Can't the old man head out to
the open sea by himself?

00:15:50.424 --> 00:15:53.424
If he stays under water, there's
no danger of him getting shot.

00:15:53.424 --> 00:15:57.524
No. Even dolphins can only stay
under for 10 minutes at most.

00:15:57.734 --> 00:15:59.964
We need you to guard him.

00:15:59.964 --> 00:16:00.804
But!

00:16:00.804 --> 00:16:01.924
Go! That's an order!

00:16:02.404 --> 00:16:05.204
We'll prove it's possible to stop a prediction!

00:16:06.204 --> 00:16:07.104
Minamoto...

00:16:07.644 --> 00:16:09.844
Don't worry. We have weapons.

00:16:09.844 --> 00:16:11.974
And you've got me along, too!

00:16:14.014 --> 00:16:15.274
S-Sakaki!

00:16:15.814 --> 00:16:16.644
Sorry about that!

00:16:18.384 --> 00:16:20.584
Minamoto's acting kind of strange.

00:16:21.054 --> 00:16:25.714
Yeah. Since when does
Mr. Honors Student fight?

00:16:26.224 --> 00:16:29.494
Mr. Igo, what did you tell Mr. Minamoto?

00:16:30.734 --> 00:16:32.194
What do you mean?

00:16:32.194 --> 00:16:35.994
When I touched Minamoto, he was protected
so I couldn't scan him.

00:16:36.674 --> 00:16:38.904
That's not something humans can do.

00:16:38.904 --> 00:16:41.534
Certainly not the honest,
kind Mr. Minamoto we know!

00:16:44.144 --> 00:16:47.784
Dammit, where's Kiritsubo?!
Why isn't he in his tent?

00:16:47.784 --> 00:16:50.554
He must have hid after he saw the explosion.

00:16:50.554 --> 00:16:53.044
Did you just shoot without
considering what would happen?

00:16:53.554 --> 00:16:55.114
Mother, you always do that!

00:16:55.584 --> 00:16:57.624
We're Normal People!

00:16:57.624 --> 00:16:59.924
We make careless, enjoyable mistakes!

00:17:03.564 --> 00:17:06.034
Terrorists shouldn't call themselves normal!

00:17:06.434 --> 00:17:07.334
Kiritsubo!

00:17:07.334 --> 00:17:09.594
I'm here too, ma'am.

00:17:10.704 --> 00:17:12.134
Drop your gun!

00:17:13.804 --> 00:17:14.344
Minamoto!

00:17:14.344 --> 00:17:15.534
BABEL dogs!
Minamoto!

00:17:24.584 --> 00:17:26.714
Figured you couldn't do this without us.

00:17:27.084 --> 00:17:29.484
Teleportation technique!

00:17:30.624 --> 00:17:32.594
Free fall!

00:17:35.494 --> 00:17:40.154
PSYCHIC... Oh, what's it called?
Those spinny things?

00:17:40.264 --> 00:17:42.664
Oh, screw it! COCONUT CRUSH!

00:17:45.634 --> 00:17:49.474
Age: 42. Typical, cute middle-aged lady,

00:17:49.474 --> 00:17:51.744
but you can't get used to your annoying
mother-in-law living with you.

00:17:51.744 --> 00:17:52.644
Stop!
but you can't get used to your annoying
