00:17:53.944 --> 00:17:55.034
Don't say that!
Just the other day, you wrung
out a dust cloth into her tea.

00:17:55.684 --> 00:17:57.254
Girls! Where's the lieutenant?

00:17:57.254 --> 00:17:58.454
In the open sea.

00:17:58.454 --> 00:18:01.384
It's okay. The sea was clear
for kilometers all around.

00:18:02.124 --> 00:18:04.424
I don't believe this... Get back to him! Hurry!

00:18:04.424 --> 00:18:06.854
Huh? The old man's coming to us!

00:18:08.364 --> 00:18:11.884
Everyone, there's a ship approaching.
It seems to be a warship.

00:18:12.364 --> 00:18:13.734
A warship?

00:18:16.064 --> 00:18:17.504
Are you all right, Chief?

00:18:17.504 --> 00:18:18.774
Kashiwagi?

00:18:18.774 --> 00:18:23.434
I'm sorry for acting on my own.
I requested an escort ship for you.

00:18:23.944 --> 00:18:25.944
Can we approach?

00:18:25.944 --> 00:18:31.174
Good timing. I wanted a place
to secure these terrorists.

00:18:31.714 --> 00:18:33.524
Has the future changed?

00:18:33.524 --> 00:18:36.384
Yeah. There won't be any more attacks, now.

00:18:39.754 --> 00:18:41.424
Hey, what's with that mood?

00:18:41.424 --> 00:18:43.364
We need to interrogate her later.

00:18:45.894 --> 00:18:48.734
We'll be standing by here for
24 hours, just to be safe.

00:18:48.734 --> 00:18:51.674
After that, Kashiwagi will come
here to relieve the chief.

00:18:52.274 --> 00:18:56.674
All right! Twenty-four hours is plenty
of time for all sorts of things!

00:18:56.674 --> 00:18:57.544
I won't forgive you if you're rude!
All right! Twenty-four hours is plenty
of time for all sorts of things!

00:18:57.544 --> 00:18:58.574
I won't forgive you if you're rude!

00:18:58.574 --> 00:19:01.044
Why so serious?

00:19:01.044 --> 00:19:04.014
She's right. You are a young man, after all.

00:19:05.484 --> 00:19:08.524
One night with four lovely
ladies on a deserted isle!

00:19:08.524 --> 00:19:10.784
We know you've wanted to take a peek at us!

00:19:11.554 --> 00:19:13.054
You don't want to be seen doing it, though.

00:19:13.054 --> 00:19:13.294
Stop it!
You don't want to be seen doing it, though.

00:19:13.294 --> 00:19:14.454
Stop it!

00:19:15.694 --> 00:19:17.254
Hey, where's the old man?

00:19:17.834 --> 00:19:19.054
He's over there.

00:19:25.534 --> 00:19:27.244
Good work, Chief.

00:19:27.244 --> 00:19:31.434
Sorry to worry you, Kashiwagi. But
what about the lieutenant's prediction?

00:19:33.784 --> 00:19:34.404
Head butt!

00:19:35.614 --> 00:19:38.844
You're finished! The Normal
People are everywhere!

00:19:41.084 --> 00:19:42.174
Chief!

00:19:48.024 --> 00:19:49.154
Lieutenant!

00:19:51.794 --> 00:19:52.994
Minamoto!

00:19:58.934 --> 00:20:02.274
That was reckless! Teleporting
yourself into the bullets' path!

00:20:02.574 --> 00:20:06.974
You planned this from the start!
To protect the chief!

00:20:07.114 --> 00:20:11.484
Espers need you people. Unlike me.

00:20:13.524 --> 00:20:16.954
Live. The children are waiting.

00:20:17.554 --> 00:20:21.024
Lieutenant! We can treat you!
One shot doesn't have to be...

00:20:21.024 --> 00:20:22.854
Minamoto! Old man!

00:20:23.794 --> 00:20:26.764
I don't like humans touching my body!

00:20:26.764 --> 00:20:28.764
"Old soldiers only fade away," they say.

00:20:28.764 --> 00:20:30.204
Lieutenant!

00:20:30.204 --> 00:20:34.834
Take care of the children.
And save my old comrade!

00:20:35.504 --> 00:20:39.344
I don't want the tragedy of sixty-five
years ago to repeat itself.

00:20:39.944 --> 00:20:41.514
May victory be yours!

00:20:41.514 --> 00:20:42.504
Lieutenant!

00:20:43.014 --> 00:20:44.984
Lieutenant! Lieutenant!

00:20:48.284 --> 00:20:50.554
You figured it out, old man?

00:21:01.164 --> 00:21:02.134
Igo...

00:21:02.864 --> 00:21:06.034
Minamoto! Of all the reckless!

00:21:06.034 --> 00:21:07.704
Even after I said you wouldn't make it!

00:21:07.704 --> 00:21:11.044
Yeah! If anything had gone wrong,
I would have been traumatized!

00:21:14.944 --> 00:21:17.414
I'm sorry. Please, stop crying.

00:21:22.584 --> 00:21:24.424
From now on, I'm sticking with you girls.

00:21:25.354 --> 00:21:27.184
Chief, what about the lieutenant?

00:21:28.164 --> 00:21:33.534
I hope he lives, but he tends not
to show up until he's needed.

00:21:36.974 --> 00:21:39.734
Honestly, my death doesn't matter.

00:21:39.734 --> 00:21:42.734
But the truth is there's
another important prediction,

00:21:45.274 --> 00:21:47.244
and if possible, I'd like to prevent it.

00:21:48.444 --> 00:21:51.414
Why did the lieutenant disappear?

00:21:51.414 --> 00:21:54.254
So I wouldn't know that what I did didn't matter?

00:21:57.154 --> 00:21:59.154
I'll believe it now!

00:21:59.154 --> 00:22:01.214
Come on, Kaoru! Your nose is running.

00:22:02.524 --> 00:22:03.834
I'll wipe it.

00:22:03.834 --> 00:22:05.664
The future can be changed!

00:22:10.774 --> 00:22:16.174
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.504
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.824
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.534 --> 00:22:44.064
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.404 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.174
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.114
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.554 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.094 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.264
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.264 --> 00:23:12.994
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.134 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.874
Anata e

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:20.474
Hai hai!

00:23:20.474 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

